 ## Operating characteristics
-*   **Time Complexity:** The complexity depends on the number of sampling planes $N$, the number of edges $E$ in the VOI, and the number of vertex events $V$. For each plane, the edge list update is $O(V)$ in the worst case, and the intersection computation is $O(E)$. With coherence, the average case is much faster, as most planes only require $O(1)$ updates [G].
-*   **Memory Complexity:** $O(E + V)$ to store the WSG and the VOI topology [G].
