+*   **Memory Complexity:** Not given in the sources.
 *   **Measured Performance:** Not given in the sources.
-*   **Strengths:** Reduces GPU computation by clipping empty regions. Exploits coherence between parallel planes. Interactive VOI definition [S1].
-*   **Limitations:** CPU-based, so it adds CPU overhead. Limited to convex VOIs [S1].
-*   **When to use:** When the VOI is convex and the user wants to interactively define the clipping region. When the GPU is the bottleneck and can benefit from reduced sampling [S1].
-*   **When not to use:** When the VOI is non-convex. When the CPU is the bottleneck [G].
