 ## Background
-The method was proposed in the paper "Real-time interactive visualization and manipulation of the volumetric data using GPU-based methods" [S1]. It addresses the need for efficient clipping of volumetric data to improve rendering performance. The WSG is a novel data structure introduced in this work to manage the topological changes during the sweep [S1].
